  "order": 8,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8rcc4y0",
      "content": "The Maratha Empire played a crucial role in Indian history after the decline of the Mughal Empire. It was founded by Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj in the 17th century. Shivaji established a strong administrative system and a powerful military. "
    },
