      "content": "6. Military System"
    },
    {
      "id": "g52xr6c",
      "type": "image",
      "imageId": "3m3fldw",
      "src": "/books/Guide/SSC GS & GK GUIDE BOOK/images/image_3m3fldw.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yenmktt",
      "content": "• Shivaji organized a strong and disciplined army.<img></img>"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7q23916",
      "content": "• He developed a powerful navy to protect the western coast."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "edyefsd",
      "content": "• He used guerrilla warfare tactics known as 'Ganimi Kava'."
    },
    {
      "id": "p62tf0m",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Revenue System"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "s3m54dm",
      "content": "• Land revenue was the main source of income."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8tv2adu",
      "content": "• Two important taxes were collected:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "kg06bjt",
      "content": "• Chauth – one-fourth of revenue collected from territories."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "oy856q4",
      "content": "• Sardeshmukhi – additional tax collected from regions."
    },
    {
      "id": "ilvn3xv",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "8. Expansion after Shivaji"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bb9366e",
      "content": "• After Shivaji's death, the Maratha Empire expanded further under the Peshwas."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rxrnz3e",
      "content": "• Peshwa Baji Rao I greatly expanded Maratha territory."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "uuqd8zu",
      "content": "• The Marathas became a major political power in India."
    },
    {
      "id": "8zimx6i",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9. Decline of the Maratha Empire"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "zbucihv",
      "content": "• The Third Battle of Panipat in 1761 weakened the Marathas."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2wvwh7d",
      "content": "• Internal conflicts among Maratha leaders."
    },
