    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5x05h39",
      "content": "• Shivaji was crowned in 1674 at Raigad."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "og3pvy2",
      "content": "• The council of ministers was called Ashta Pradhan."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "mqm90zf",
      "content": "• Shivaji used guerrilla warfare tactics."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "rt6a7at",
      "content": "• Chauth and Sardeshmukhi were Maratha taxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "d4pz8gu",
      "content": "• Third Battle of Panipat (1761) weakened Maratha power."
    }
